Portions of the safety layer in this package (src/safety/rules.ts,
src/safety/gate.ts, src/safety/classify.ts) and the agent command
vocabulary in src/types.ts were adapted from the author's own MIT-licensed
projects:

  - dodis-browser  — safety rule engine, action gate, action classification,
                     viewport presets, agent command union
  - Dodis          — safety-gate semantics (effect ranking, URL/action rules)
  - Orca           — browser session and agent-bridge patterns

Adapted rather than copied verbatim: the driver is CDP-based rather than
Electron-based, the `eval` command was removed, `file://` and private-range
navigation are denied by default rather than allowed, and the `mask` effect
is implemented here (it was declared but unimplemented upstream).
